Files: iOS/Keyboard/Resources/vnlm.bin
Copyright: Wikimedia contributors (Vietnamese Wikipedia, Wikisource, Wikibooks,
 Wikivoyage, Wikiquote); Tatoeba contributors
Comment: Installed as /usr/share/viettelex/vnlm.bin (viettelex-text-tools). Syllable
 n-gram statistics derived from those texts (CC BY-SA 4.0 / CC BY 2.0 FR); transformed:
 syllable split, n-gram counts, Kneser-Ney smoothing, pruning, quantisation,
 compression. Released under CC BY-SA 4.0. Sources: docs/DATA-SOURCES.md.
License: CC-BY-SA-4.0
 https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode

Files: iOS/Keyboard/Resources/vnlexicon.bin
Copyright: 2026 The VietTelex authors; frequencies from hermitdave/FrequencyWords
Comment: Installed as /usr/share/viettelex/vnlexicon.bin. Syllable list + frequencies
 (OpenSubtitles-derived counts, FrequencyWords content CC BY-SA 4.0).
License: CC-BY-SA-4.0
 https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode

Files: iOS/Keyboard/Resources/enlexicon.bin
Copyright: Google (Google Books Ngram data); orgtre/google-books-ngram-frequency;
 2015 Ilya Semenov (wikipedia-word-frequency)
Comment: Installed as /usr/share/viettelex/enlexicon.bin. English word list + 1-byte
 frequencies; filtered, merged, rescaled. Sources: docs/DATA-SOURCES.md.
License: CC-BY-3.0
 https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/legalcode

